This decomposition ensures finite stress-energy across the horizon.

\section{Oracle Null Sector and Halting Trap Elimination}
States with $\omega_m = 0$ are projected into the oracle null sector:
\begin{equation}
\hat{\Omega}_{\text{uncomp}} | \psi_m \rangle = 0.
\end{equation}
This eliminates infinite-recursion microstates and prevents halting traps in
collapse simulations.

